{"overview":"آکیرا تودو همیشه در سایهٔ خواهرش، هارکا، که به‌طور مخفیانه «موتور» مرموز پدرشان را کنترل می‌کند، زندگی کرده است. اما وقتی دشمنی مرموز برای خانواده‌اش می‌آید، آکیرا مجبور می‌شود در نبردی شرکت کند که کل جهان را تهدید می‌کند. او شاید هیچ‌یک از قدرت پدرش را به ارث نبره، اما حالا باید راهی برای مقابله پیدا کند؛ وگرنه همهٔ آنچه دوست دارد را از دست خواهد داد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Akira Todo has always lived in the shadow of his sister, Haruka, who secretly wields their father’s mysterious “Engine.” But when a mysterious enemy comes for his family, Akira is forced into a battle that threatens the entire world. He may have inherited none of his father’s power, but now he must find a way to fight back. Or risk losing everything he cares about.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/q4Frct3HP4eaFs7hc8fHq04Rl6Y.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小市眞琴","role":"Akira Todo (voice)","photo":"/gpslQDgkGoL3Ap9QsK1nljeGPKJ.jpg","en":"Makoto Koichi"},{"name":"کائده هوندو","role":"Haruka Todo (voice)","photo":"/11BcHnuJYrOZhIftgUiQqfm7TK6.jpg","en":"Kaede Hondo"},{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Eleanor Northbrook (voice)","photo":"/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","en":"Ami Koshimizu"},{"name":"潘めぐみ","role":"Lala Zudenstein (voice)","photo":"/cwnwrPg1YvB19TbfouC4ShGPmbQ.jpg","en":"Megumi Han"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Yoko Nishina (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"},{"name":"浦和希","role":"Alan (voice)","photo":"/7eUgENWREmWSMnLPUFCQhvUSpdI.jpg","en":"Kazuki Ura"},{"name":"水樹奈々","role":"EDVA (voice)","photo":"/rQBo7HyjTIqeB7hIofb7uJFhiVs.jpg","en":"Nana Mizuki"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/317259/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTw